sub bug-report | Create a pre-populated GitHub issue with information about y
sub completions | Generate starship shell completions for your shell to stdout
sub config | Edit the starship configuration
sub explain | Explains the currently showing modules
sub init | Prints the shell function used to execute starship
sub module | Prints a specific prompt module
sub preset | Prints a preset config
sub print-config | Prints the computed starship configuration
sub prompt | Prints the full starship prompt
sub session | Generate random session key
sub statusline | Prints the statusline with a specific profile
sub timings | Prints timings of all active modules
sub toggle | Toggle a given starship module
sub help | Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
flag -h --help | Print help
flag -V --version | Print version
